  "detail_text": "Registration Deadlines and Instructions . All participants must register to participate in this industry day. Interested parties must submit their registration via email, within the registration window for attendance. Registration Window : April 24, 2026 through May 8, 2026 Registration Email : christopher.t.frost4.civ@mail.mil Required Information : Email Subject : [Company Name], \"PPA IT Softwarre Solutions\" Email Body : Company name, attendee names and titles Contact information for each attendee A brief capability statement highlighting relevant IT software solutions. If you request to demonstrate your IT software solution capability to the PPA. See provided document for additional information.",
